      "messages": {
        "202070000": {
          "id": 202070000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "파트너! 우리끼리 약속한 거 기억해요?",
          "next": [
            202070001
          ]
        },
        "202070001": {
          "id": 202070001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "「별바다 전기」의 엔딩에 관한 거요",
          "next": [
            202070002,
            202070004,
            202070005
          ]
        },
        "202070002": {
          "id": 202070002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "물론 기억하죠. 하지만 지금은 당신이 직접 보는 게 좋겠어요",
          "next": [
            202070003
          ]
        },
        "202070003": {
          "id": 202070003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "너무 재밌어서 스포일러는 하고 싶지 않네요",
          "next": [
            202070006
          ]
        },
        "202070004": {
          "id": 202070004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "직접 보는 게 좋겠어요. 너무 재밌어서 스포일러는 하고 싶지 않네요",
          "next": [
            202070006
          ]
        },
        "202070005": {
          "id": 202070005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "전 아직 안 봤어요",
          "next": [
            202070006
          ]
        },
        "202070006": {
          "id": 202070006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "헤헤, 사실 얼마 전에 참지 못하고 몰래 봤어요",
          "next": [
            202070007
          ]
        },
        "202070007": {
          "id": 202070007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "시공간을 넘은 용사들은 힘을 합쳐서 마지막 괴물을 물리쳤어요. 하지만 괴물의 힘에 의해 이세계로 텔레포트 되었고, 모든 것을 처음부터 다시 시작하게 되었죠",
          "next": [
            202070008
          ]
        },
        "202070008": {
          "id": 202070008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "그 다음엔 무슨 일이 일어났는지 너무 궁금한데, 이야기는 여기서 끝나버렸어요!",
          "next": [
            202070009
          ]
        },
        "202070009": {
          "id": 202070009,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "next": [
            202070010,
            202070012,
            202070014
          ]
        },
        "202070010": {
          "id": 202070010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "그게 말이 되나요!",
          "next": [
            202070011
          ]
        },
        "202070011": {
          "id": 202070011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "당신도 그렇게 생각하죠?",
          "next": [
            202070016
          ]
        },
        "202070012": {
          "id": 202070012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "좋아요, 그럼 당신이 써요!",
          "next": [
            202070013
          ]
        },
        "202070013": {
          "id": 202070013,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "next": [
            202070016
          ]
        },
        "202070014": {
          "id": 202070014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "독자에게 상상할 여지를 남기는 것도 글쓰기의 한 기법이죠",
          "next": [
            202070015
          ]
        },
        "202070015": {
          "id": 202070015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "좋아요, 그렇다면 목적을 달성했네요!",
          "next": [
            202070016
          ]
        },
        "202070016": {
          "id": 202070016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "하지만 이런 게 다음 책을 펼치게 되는 원동력이죠",
          "next": [
            202070017
          ]
        },
        "202070017": {
          "id": 202070017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "파트너, 요즘 재밌게 본 책 있어요? 읽을 책이 없네요",
          "next": [
            202070018,
            202070021,
            202070023
          ]
        },
        "202070018": {
          "id": 202070018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Mar. 7th가 전에 쓴 단편 추리소설을 강력 추천해요",
          "next": [
            202070019
          ]
        },
        "202070019": {
          "id": 202070019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "범인이 누구인지, 심지어 몇 명인지 절대 맞힐 수 없을 거예요",
          "next": [
            202070020
          ]
        },
        "202070020": {
          "id": 202070020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "다음에 링크 보내 줄게요",
          "next": [
            202070025
          ]
        },
        "202070021": {
          "id": 202070021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "카스토리스 선생님의 동인 소설을 강력 추천해요",
          "next": [
            202070022
          ]
        },
        "202070022": {
          "id": 202070022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "스타일이 다양해서, 당신을 감탄하게 하는 글이 반드시 있을 거예요",
          "next": [
            202070025
          ]
        },
        "202070023": {
          "id": 202070023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "앰포리어스의 서적 중에는 세상을 놀라게 한 작품이 많죠",
          "next": [
            202070024
          ]
        },
        "202070024": {
          "id": 202070024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "다시 한번 생각해 보고, 목록을 정리해 볼게요",
          "next": [
            202070025
          ]
        },
        "202070025": {
          "id": 202070025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "좋아요! 정말 기대되네요",
          "next": [
            202070026
          ]
        },
        "202070026": {
          "id": 202070026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "재밌는 거 있으면 저도 추천할게요",
          "next": [
            202070027
          ]
        },
